      "text": "1. The first sentence of subsection 305(a) of Executive Order No. \n106471  of November 28, 1955, is amended to read:\n“A t least once every twelve months the Chairman of the Civil \nService Commission shall survey appointments made under section \n710(b) (1) of the Act.”"
    },
